 host name: ",by:'<p><strong>Autom\u0101tisk\u0101 apmaksa ar karti</strong></p><br><ul><li>Jums tiks piesl\u0113gta autom\u0101tisk\u0101 \u0122imenes komplekta apmaksa ar karti l\u012bdz nor\u0101d\u012btajam datumam.</li><li>Apmaksa tiks veikta 1 reizi m\u0113nes\u012b.</li><li>Atteikties no autom\u0101tisk\u0101s apmaksas var\u0113siet jebkur\u0101 laik\u0101 sada\u013c\u0101 "\u0122imenes komplekts".</li><li>Apmaks\u0101tais r\u0113\u0137ins tiks nos\u016bt\u012bts uz J\u016bsu E-klases pastu.</li><li>Apmaks\u0101tais r\u0113\u0137ins nav der\u012bgs n\u0101kam\u0101 maks\u0101juma veik\u0161anai, l\u016bdzam to neizmantot k\u0101 paraugu n\u0101kam\u0101 maks\u0101juma veik\u0161anai.</li></ul><br><p> Pakalpojumu nodro\u0161ina:<br>SIA Izgl\u012bt\u012bbas sist\u0113mas, re\u0123. nr.: 40103493322<br>Juridisk\u0101 adrese: \u010cuibes iela 17, R\u012bga, LV-1063, Latvija.</p>',i6:"<p><strong>Internetbankas apmaksa</strong></p><br><ul><li>Apmaks\u0101tais r\u0113\u0137ins tiks nos\u016bt\u012bts uz J\u016bsu E-klases pastu.</li><li>Apmaks\u0101tais r\u0113\u0137ins nav der\u012bgs n\u0101kam\u0101 maks\u0101juma veik\u0161anai, l\u016bdzam to neizmantot k\u0101 paraugu n\u0101kam\u0101 maks\u0101juma veik\u0161anai.</li></ul><br><p> Pakalpojumu nodro\u0161ina:<br>SIA Izgl\u012bt\u012bbas sist\u0113mas, re\u0123. nr.: 40103493322<br>Juridisk\u0101 adrese: \u010cuibes iela 17, R\u012bga, LV-1063, Latvija.</p>",_:"<p>Dodieties uz sada\u013cu <i>Notifik\u0101cijas</i> un veiciet nepiecie\u0161amos uzst\u0101d\u012bjumus.</p>",G:"<p>E-klases darb\u012bba tiek nodro\u0161in\u0101ta, pateicoties izgl\u012bt\u012bbas iest\u0101\u017eu finans\u0113jumam un lietot\u0101jiem, kuri izmanto papla\u0161in\u0101t\u0101s funkcionalit\u0101tes \u0122imenes komplektu.</p>\n<p>E-klase netiek finansi\u0101li atbalst\u012bta no valsts vai Eiropas Savien\u012bbas. Lai E-klases lietot\u0101ju skaits b\u016btu iesp\u0113jami pla\u0161s un past\u0101v\u0113tu iesp\u0113ja to izmanot ar\u012b bez maksas, papildus \u0122imenes komplekta lietot\u0101ju un izgl\u012bt\u012bbas iest\u0101\u017eu maks\u0101jumiem E-klas\u0113 tiek izvietotas rekl\u0101mas.</p>\n<p>\u0122imenes komplekta lietot\u0101jiem ir iesp\u0113ja atsl\u0113gt rekl\u0101mas sada\u013c\u0101 <i>\u0122imenes komplekts</i>.</p>",v:"<p>E-klases dizains nodro\u0161ina \u0113rtu funkcionalit\u0101ti neatkar\u012bgi no izmantot\u0101s ier\u012bces \u2013 telefona, datora vai plan\u0161etes.</p>\n<p>Apple iOS un Android lietot\u0101jiem pieejama ar\u012b E-klases aplik\u0101cija. Izmantojot aplik\u0101ciju, paroli iesp\u0113jams saglab\u0101t, lai pie katras piesl\u0113g\u0161an\u0101s reizes t\u0101 nav j\u0101ievada atk\u0101rtoti.</p>",p:"<p>Ekr\u0101na labaj\u0101 aug\u0161\u0113j\u0101 st\u016br\u012b ir nor\u0101d\u012bta lietot\u0101ja loma. Lietot\u0101ja lomas ikona un nosaukums: <i>t\u0113tis, mamma vai skol\u0113ns.</i></p>",g0:"<p>Ieraksti vec\u0101ku sarun\u0101s ir pieejama tikai konkr\u0113t\u0101s klases vec\u0101kiem.</p>\n<p>Ieraksti tiek saglab\u0101ti l\u012bdz m\u0101c\u012bbu gada beig\u0101m.</p>",ef:"<p>Ja E-klas\u0113 ir nepareizi nor\u0101d\u012bti dati par skol\u0113nu vai vec\u0101kiem, sazinieties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju E-klases past\u0101 un pal\u016bdziet, lai audzin\u0101t\u0101js veic nepiecie\u0161amos labojumus vai ievada iztr\u016bksto\u0161o inform\u0101ciju.</p>",mE:"<p>Ja E-klas\u0113 ir nepareizi nor\u0101d\u012bti dati, sazinieties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju E-klases past\u0101 un pal\u016bdziet, lai audzin\u0101t\u0101js veic nepiecie\u0161amos labojumus vai ievada iztr\u016bksto\u0161o inform\u0101ciju</p>",u:"<p>Ja jaut\u0101jums ir par m\u0101c\u012bbu darba organiz\u0101ciju (atz\u012bm\u0113m, kav\u0113jumiem, stund\u0101m u.c.), s\u016btiet v\u0113stuli klases audzin\u0101t\u0101jam vai priek\u0161meta skolot\u0101jam <i>E-klases past\u0101</i>.</p><p>Ja jaut\u0101jums ir par E-klases sist\u0113mas darb\u012bbu, aizpildiet Tehnisk\u0101 atbalsta <a href='support'>sazi\u0146as formu</a>.</p>",c:"<p>Ja v\u0113laties, varat izveidot sev t\u012bkamu lietot\u0101jv\u0101rdu, ko viegl\u0101k atcer\u0113ties un \u0113rt\u0101k izmantot. E-klasei var\u0113s piesl\u0113gties gan ar izveidoto lietot\u0101jv\u0101rdu, gan ar skol\u0113na personas kodu. Lietot\u0101jv\u0101rdu var izveidot vai main\u012bt sada\u013c\u0101 <i>Uzst\u0101d\u012bjumi</i>.</p>",a:"<p>Lai sa\u0146emtu jaunu skol\u0113na paroli, s\u016btiet SMS no <b>skol\u0113na</b> telefona ar tekstu: EK xxxxxx-xxxxx uz numuru 1800 (xxxxxx-xxxxx viet\u0101 j\u0101raksta skol\u0113na personas kods).</p><p>Ja skol\u0113na telefona numurs nav re\u0123istr\u0113ts E-klas\u0113, pal\u016bdziet klases audzin\u0101t\u0101jam, lai ievada E-klas\u0113 skol\u0113na telefona numuru. Tikl\u012bdz tas b\u016bs izdar\u012bts, skol\u0113ns sa\u0146ems SMS ar jaunu E-klases paroli.</p><p>Ja skol\u0113nam nav sava telefona, pal\u016bdziet audzin\u0101t\u0101jam, lai izveido skol\u0113na paroli manu\u0101li.</p><p>Vis\u0113rt\u0101k sazin\u0101ties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju ir E-klases past\u0101.</p>",jV:"<p>Lietot\u0101ja lomu nosaka izmantot\u0101 parole. Katram lietot\u0101jam (skol\u0113nam, t\u0113tim, mammai) ir paredz\u0113ta sava parole.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\nLai ieg\u016btu atbilsto\u0161o paroli, no sava telefona s\u016btiet SMS ar tekstu: \nek xxxxxx-xxxxx uz numuru 1800 (xxxxxx-xxxxx viet\u0101 j\u0101raksta skol\u0113na personas kods) \n</li>\n<li>\nJa neizdodas sa\u0146emt SMS ar paroli, sazinieties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju un pal\u016bdziet, lai Jums izsniedz jaunu paroli. </li>\n</ul>",dg:"<p>Lietot\u0101ja lomu nosaka izmantot\u0101 parole. Katram lietot\u0101jam (skol\u0113nam, t\u0113tim, mammai) ir paredz\u0113ta sava parole.</p><ul><li>Lai ieg\u016btu atbilsto\u0161o paroli, no sava telefona s\u016btiet SMS ar tekstu: ek xxxxxx-xxxxx uz numuru 1800 (xxxxxx-xxxxx viet\u0101 j\u0101raksta skol\u0113na personas kods)</li><li>Ja neizdodas sa\u0146emt SMS ar paroli, sazinieties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju un pal\u016bdziet, lai Jums izsniedz jaunu paroli.</li></ul>",dw:"<p>Lietot\u0101jiem ir at\u0161\u0137ir\u012bgas paroles un lomas E-klas\u0113.</p>\n<p>Atbilsto\u0161as paroles lieto\u0161ana ir \u013coti b\u016btiska, jo katram lietot\u0101jam ir savi person\u012bgie sazi\u0146as r\u012bki E-klas\u0113 un inform\u0101cijas apmai\u0146a bie\u017ei vien ir konfidenci\u0101la. Skol\u0113niem un vec\u0101kiem at\u0161\u0137iras E-klases funkcionalit\u0101te.</p>",bc:"<p>Lietot\u0101jiem ir at\u0161\u0137ir\u012bgas paroles un lomas E-klas\u0113.</p><p>Atbilsto\u0161as paroles lieto\u0161ana ir \u013coti b\u016btiska, jo katram lietot\u0101jam ir savi person\u012bgie sazi\u0146as r\u012bki E-klas\u0113 un inform\u0101cijas apmai\u0146a bie\u017ei vien ir konfidenci\u0101la. Skol\u0113niem un vec\u0101kiem at\u0161\u0137iras E-klases funkcionalit\u0101te.</p>",Q:"<p>Paroli iesp\u0113jams nomain\u012bt sada\u013c\u0101 <i>Uzst\u0101d\u012bjumi</i>.</p>",gr:"<p>Sarakste E-klases past\u0101 ir konfidenci\u0101la.</p>\n<p>Lai J\u016bsu sarakste nenon\u0101ktu citu personu rok\u0101s, glab\u0101jiet savu E-klases paroli atbild\u012bgi un nenododiet to citai personai (ar\u012b b\u0113rnam). Beidzot darbu E-klas\u0113, vienm\u0113r nospiediet pogu <i>Iziet</i>.</p>",eW:"<p>Sarakste E-klases past\u0101 ir konfidenci\u0101la.</p>\n<p>Sarakste E-klases past\u0101 ir konfidenci\u0101la.\nLai J\u016bsu sarakste nenon\u0101ktu citu personu rok\u0101s, glab\u0101jiet savu E-klases paroli atbild\u012bgi un nenododiet to citai personai (ar\u012b vec\u0101kiem). Beidzot darbu E-klas\u0113, vienm\u0113r nospiediet pogu <i>Iziet</i>.\n</p>",fx:"<p>Sazinieties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju un pal\u016bdziet, lai ievada J\u016bsu mobil\u0101 telefona numuru E-klas\u0113. L\u012bdz ko klases audzin\u0101t\u0101js E-klas\u0113 re\u0123istr\u0113s telefona numuru, uz to atn\u0101ks SMS ar paroli. Lietot\u0101jv\u0101rds paliks nemain\u012bgs - skol\u0113na personas kods</p>",dl:"<p>Sazinieties ar skolas klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju un pal\u016bdziet, lai ievada J\u016bsu mobil\u0101 telefona numuru E-klas\u0113. L\u012bdz ko klases audzin\u0101t\u0101js E-klas\u0113 re\u0123istr\u0113s telefona numuru, uz to atn\u0101ks SMS ar paroli. Lietot\u0101jv\u0101rds paliks nemain\u012bgs - skol\u0113na personas kods.</p>",i:"<p>Skol\u0113nam un vec\u0101kiem lietot\u0101jv\u0101rds ir skol\u0113na personas kods (xxxxxx-xxxxx). Katram lietot\u0101jam j\u0101piesl\u0113dzas ar savu paroli.</p>\n<p>Darbiniekiem - savs personas kods.</p>",L:"<p>Stundu <i>s\u0101kuma/beigu laiki</i> un E-klas\u0113 izmantoto <i>apz\u012bm\u0113jumu skaidrojumi</i> atrodami E-klases lejasda\u013c\u0101.</p>",ay:"<p>Vec\u0101s skolas profilu iesp\u0113jams atsl\u0113gt sada\u013c\u0101 <i>Uzst\u0101d\u012bjumi</i>.</p>",k:"<p>\u0122imenes komplekta ieg\u0101di iesp\u0113jams veikt sada\u013c\u0101 <i>\u0122imenes komplekts</i> ar internetbankas starpniec\u012bbu, maks\u0101juma karti vai SMS.</p><p>Izdev\u012bg\u0101k un \u0113rt\u0101k b\u016bs ieg\u0101d\u0101ties \u0122imenes komplektu uzreiz l\u012bdz m\u0101c\u012bbu gada beig\u0101m.</p>",fL:"<p>\u0122imenes komplekta lietot\u0101ji var \u0113rti pievienot skol\u0113nus sada\u013c\u0101 <i>Uzst\u0101d\u012bjumi</i>.</p><p>B\u0113rnus var pievienot ar\u012b tad, ja vi\u0146i m\u0101c\u0101s da\u017e\u0101d\u0101s skol\u0101s. Katram b\u0113rnam var pievienot visas vi\u0146a apmekl\u0113t\u0101s m\u0101c\u012bbu iest\u0101des, piem\u0113ram, skolu un m\u016bzikas skolu. Ieg\u0101d\u0101tais \u0122imenes komplekts un t\u0101 \u0113rt\u012bbas attiecas uz visiem pievienotajiem skol\u0113niem.</p>",W:"<p>\u0122imenes komplekta lietot\u0101jiem ir iesp\u0113ja sa\u0146emt jaun\u0101k\u0101s atz\u012bmes, skolot\u0101ju zi\u0146ojumus ar SMS vai uz e-pastu.</p><p>Dodieties uz sada\u013cu <i>Notifik\u0101cijas</i> un uzst\u0101diet sev v\u0113lam\u0101s inform\u0101cijas sa\u0146em\u0161anu SMS un/vai e-pasta form\u0101.</p><p>Jaun\u0101k\u0101s atz\u012bmes tiek s\u016bt\u012btas vienu reizi dien\u0101 \u2013 p\u0113c plkst. 19.00. Skolot\u0101ju zi\u0146ojumi un E-klases pasta v\u0113stules \u2013 tikl\u012bdz tiek sa\u0146emta jauna zi\u0146a.</p>",jW:"<p>\u0122imenes komplekts nodro\u0161ina papla\u0161in\u0101tu E-klases funkcionalit\u0101ti un liel\u0101kas \u0113rt\u012bbas lietot\u0101jam. \u0122imenes komplekta lietot\u0101jiem pieejam\u0101s papildu funkcijas:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>jaun\u0101k\u0101s atz\u012bmes un skolot\u0101ju zi\u0146oju E-klases s\u0101kumlap\u0101;</li>\n<li>notifik\u0101ciju sa\u0146em\u0161ana uz nor\u0101d\u012bto e-pasta adresi un/vai SMS zi\u0146ojumi, sa\u0146emot b\u016btisk\u0101ko inform\u0101ciju sev \u0113rt\u0101 veid\u0101;</li>\n<li>iesp\u0113ja apvienot vien\u0101 lietot\u0101ja kont\u0101 visus savus b\u0113rnus un m\u0101c\u012bbu iest\u0101des, kur\u0101s vi\u0146i m\u0101c\u0101s, lai nav j\u0101izmanto vair\u0101ki lietot\u0101ju konti un paroles;</li>\n<li>piek\u013cuve sekmju reitingiem (apkopojumiem) un da\u017e\u0101diem p\u0101rskatiem par m\u0101c\u012bbu procesu;</li>\n<li>iesp\u0113ja atsl\u0113gt rekl\u0101mas;</li>\n<li>aplik\u0101cija ar iesp\u0113ju saglab\u0101t paroli.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>E-klase ir projekts, kas nesa\u0146em valsts vai Eiropas Savien\u012bbas atbalstu un to finans\u0113 t\u0101 lietot\u0101ji.</p>\n<p>Vair\u0101k par \u0122imenes komplekta iesp\u0113j\u0101m un priek\u0161roc\u012bb\u0101m lasiet sada\u013c\u0101 <i>\u0122imenes komplekts</i>.</p>",l1:"<p>\u0122imenes komplekts nodro\u0161ina papla\u0161in\u0101tu E-klases funkcionalit\u0101ti un liel\u0101kas \u0113rt\u012bbas lietot\u0101jam. \u0122imenes komplekta lietot\u0101jiem pieejam\u0101s papildu funkcijas:</p><ul><li>jaun\u0101k\u0101s atz\u012bmes un skolot\u0101ju zi\u0146ojumi E-klases s\u0101kumlap\u0101;</li><li>notifik\u0101ciju sa\u0146em\u0161ana uz nor\u0101d\u012bto e-pasta adresi un/vai SMS zi\u0146ojumi, sa\u0146emot b\u016btisk\u0101ko inform\u0101ciju sev \u0113rt\u0101 veid\u0101;</li><li>iesp\u0113ja apvienot vien\u0101 lietot\u0101ja kont\u0101 visus savus b\u0113rnus un m\u0101c\u012bbu iest\u0101des, kur\u0101s vi\u0146i m\u0101c\u0101s, lai nav j\u0101izmanto vair\u0101ki lietot\u0101ju konti un paroles;</li><li>piek\u013cuve sekmju reitingiem (apkopojumiem) un da\u017e\u0101diem p\u0101rskatiem par m\u0101c\u012bbu procesu;</li><li>iesp\u0113ja atsl\u0113gt rekl\u0101mas;</li><li>aplik\u0101cija ar iesp\u0113ju saglab\u0101t paroli.</li></ul><p>E-klase ir projekts, kas nesa\u0146em valsts vai Eiropas Savien\u012bbas atbalstu un to finans\u0113 t\u0101 lietot\u0101ji.</p><p>Vair\u0101k par \u0122imenes komplekta iesp\u0113j\u0101m un priek\u0161roc\u012bb\u0101m lasiet sada\u013c\u0101 \u0122imenes komplekts.</p>",C:"===== asynchronous gap ===========================\n",A:"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789+/",eK:"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789-_",T:"ASN1 Encoding failed. This should never happen",l6:'Abonementu iesp\u0113jams atsl\u0113gt "\u0122imenes komplekts" sada\u013c\u0101 jebkur\u0101 laik\u0101.',jc:"Aktu\u0101l\u0101s inform\u0101cijas un pazi\u0146ojumu apkopojums vienuviet. P\u0101rskati skol\u0101 notieko\u0161o, jaun\u0101kos v\u0113rt\u0113jums un jaunumus S\u0101kuma lap\u0101, esi inform\u0113ts.",nl:"Autom\u0101tisko pagarin\u0101\u0161anu var atsl\u0113gt Uzst\u0101d\u012bjumu sada\u013c\u0101 jebkur\u0101 laik\u0101.",c6:"Broadcast stream controllers do not support pause callbacks",fS:"Called rasterize() with a different number of canvases and pictures.",J:"Cannot change handlers of asBroadcastStream source subscription.",aa:"Cannot extract a file path from a URI with a fragment component",aM:"Cannot extract a file path from a URI with a query component",kY:"Cannot extract a non-Windows file path from a file URI with an authority",oQ:"Cannot fire new event. Controller is already firing an event",n7:"Catering status polling timed out after 15 attempts",bv:"Catering status polling timed out after 30 attempts",aV:"E-klase ir b\u016btiska izgl\u012bt\u012bbas sist\u0113mas sast\u0101vda\u013ca. E-klases uzdevums ir veicin\u0101t kvalitat\u012bvu izgl\u012bt\u012bbas procesu un nodro\u0161in\u0101t efekt\u012bvu inform\u0101cijas apmai\u0146u, sadarbojoties ar da\u017e\u0101d\u0101m iesaist\u012btaj\u0101m pus\u0113m \u2013 skol\u0113niem, vec\u0101kiem, skolot\u0101jiem, m\u0101c\u012bbu satura veidot\u0101jiem, pa\u0161vald\u012bb\u0101m, k\u0101 ar\u012b izgl\u012bt\u012bbas un valsts iest\u0101d\u0113m.\n\n\u0112rtai un dro\u0161ai E-klases lieto\u0161anai, Lietot\u0101ju interes\u0113s ir iepaz\u012bties un iev\u0113rot zem\u0101k aprakst\u012btos noteikumus. Lieto\u0161anas noteikumi nosaka k\u0101rt\u012bbu, k\u0101d\u0101 E-klases lietot\u0101ji (turpm\u0101k - Lietot\u0101ji) lieto E-klas\u0113 pieejamo inform\u0101ciju un pakalpojumus.",iy:"EkLayoutInheritedWidget not found in context",nk:"Error handler must accept one Object or one Object and a StackTrace as arguments, and return a value of the returned future's type",dr:"Failed to accept join offer for personalId: ",no:"Failed to change advertising settings for user: ",lS:"Failed to change commercial news settings for user: ",a2:"Failed to convert text image bitmap to an SkImage.",gD:"Failed to load evaluation details for id: ",ld:"Failed to load non-attendance reports, returning empty list",M:"Failed to parse extra parameters when navigating to HomeTaskDetailsPage.",E:"Failed to poll non-attendance catering status. Ignoring and continuing",k6:"Failed to re-request catering cancellation",ao:"Failed to send change phone number request",l:"Host platform returned null value for non-null return value.",bJ:"Iesp\u0113ja sekot skol\u0113na skolas gait\u0101m neapmekl\u0113jot E-klasi. Uzst\u0101dot pazi\u0146ojumu sa\u0146em\u0161anu, iesp\u0113jams sa\u0146emt v\u0113lamo inform\u0101ciju par skolnieka skolas gait\u0101m ar SMS vai uz e-pastu.",ly:"Ietaupi laiku un esi inform\u0113ts! Seko svar\u012bg\u0101kajai inform\u0101cijai par sekm\u0113m, kav\u0113jumiem un skolot\u0101ja pazi\u0146ojumiem. Sa\u0146em SMS dienas apkopojumu un skolot\u0101ju v\u0113stules uz priv\u0101to e-pastu.",ff:"Ievadiet personas kodu pareiz\u0101 form\u0101t\u0101 (XXXXXX-XXXXX vai XXXXXXXXXXX)",jh:"Inform\u0101cija par izmai\u0146\u0101m tiks nodota izgl\u012bt\u012bbas iest\u0101dei un \u0113din\u0101t\u0101jiem.",kd:"Initialization vector must be the same length as block size",oJ:"Internal error: expected positive number, got ",k_:"Izgl\u012btojamo speci\u0101lo vajadz\u012bbu izv\u0113rt\u0113\u0161ana pirmsskolas izgl\u012bt\u012bbas iest\u0101d\u0113",ni:"Ja profilu izv\u0113l\u0113 pietr\u016bkst k\u0101ds skol\u0113ns vai skola, sazinieties ar klases audzin\u0101t\u0101ju, un pal\u016bdziet, lai re\u0123istr\u0113 J\u016bsu telefona numuru\xa0E\u2011klas\u0113.\xa0Tikl\u012bdz tas b\u016bs izdar\u012bts, var\u0113siet piek\u013c\u016bt \u0161im profilam.",iH:"Jaunumi par\u0101d\u012bsies \u0161eit, tikl\u012bdz tie b\u016bs public\u0113ti.",o5:"J\u016bs esat p\u0101rsniedzis 10 000 rakstz\u012bmju limitu.",gs:"J\u016bsu iesniegums E-klases past\u0101 tiks nos\u016bt\u012bts klases audzin\u0101t\u0101jam. Kad l\u016bgums tiks izpild\u012bts, uz J\u016bsu nor\u0101d\u012bto telefona numuru autom\u0101tiski tiks nos\u016bt\u012bta jaun\u0101 parole.",bV:"Kartes abonementu var atcelt tikai vienu reizi. To atk\u0101rtoti aktiviz\u0113t b\u016bs iesp\u0113jams tikai p\u0113c n\u0101kam\u0101 abonementa ieg\u0101des.",bD:"Ko dar\u012bt, ja E-klas\u0113 ir nepiln\u012bgi vai neprec\u012bzi dati par vec\u0101kiem vai b\u0113rniem?",lB:"Ko dar\u012bt, ja mani dati E-klas\u0113 ir nepiln\u012bgi vai neprec\u012bzi?",cN:"Ko dar\u012bt, ja neredzu skolu, kur\u0101 pa\u0161laik m\u0101cos?",kN:"Ko dar\u012bt, ja neredzu skolu, kur\u0101 pa\u0161laik m\u0101c\u0101s b\u0113rns?",Z:"Kur mekl\u0113t stundu s\u0101kumu/beigas un apz\u012bm\u0113jumu skaidrojumus?",lb:"K\u0101 atsl\u0113gt skolas profilu, kur\u0101 mans b\u0113rns vairs nem\u0101c\u0101s?",d:"K\u0101 ieg\u0101d\u0101ties vai pagarin\u0101t \u0122imenes komplektu?",m9:"K\u0101 pievienot savus b\u0113rnus E-klases profilam?",f:"K\u0101 p\u0101radres\u0113t E-klases pasta v\u0113stules uz priv\u0101to e-pastu?",O:"K\u0101 sa\u0146emt atz\u012bmes mobilaj\u0101 telefon\u0101 un priv\u0101taj\u0101 e-past\u0101?",Y:"K\u0101 var zin\u0101t, kuru lietot\u0101ja lomu lietoju?",h:"K\u013c\u016bda, neizdev\u0101s sa\u0146emt inform\u0101ciju no sist\u0113mas",o:"Lost focus. Detaching TextInputClient from TextInput.",eX:"M\u0113s veicam uzlabojumus, un m\u0101jaslapa uz \u012bsu br\u012bdi nav pieejama. L\u016bdzu, m\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113l\u0101k. Paldies par sapratni!",q:"Nav ierakstu vai nav rezult\u0101tu, kas atbilst izv\u0113l\u0113tajiem filtriem.",x:"Node already has a parent, copy or remove it first",P:"None of the patterns in the switch expression the matched input value. See https://github.com/dart-lang/language/issues/3488 for details.",nF:"Not building expanded handles because the text layout reported a zero line-height",es:"Pal\u012bdzi skol\u0113nam m\u0101c\u012bb\u0101s! Vienk\u0101r\u0161i un \u0113rti seko uzdotajam un sekm\u0113m no jebkuras ier\u012bces \u2013 jebkur\u0101 br\u012bd\u012b.",s:'PathMetricIterator is not pointing to a PathMetric. This can happen in two situations:\n- The iteration has not started yet. If so, call "moveNext" to start iteration.\n- The iterator ran out of elements. If so, check that "moveNext" returns true prior to calling "current".',eF:"Piel\u0101go E-klasi sav\u0101m vajadz\u012bb\u0101m un sa\u0146em inform\u0101ciju sev \u0113rt\u0101 veid\u0101. Jaun\u0101k\u0101 inform\u0101cija vienm\u0113r izcelta. Iesp\u0113ja ierobe\u017eot rekl\u0101mas.",bt:"Pie\u0161\u0137ir sa\u0146emtajiem v\u0113rt\u0113jumiem kontekstu. Sekmju reitingi \u013cauj \u0113rti sekot vid\u0113jiem v\u0113rt\u0113jumiem gan kop\u012bgi vis\u0101 klas\u0113, gan atsevi\u0161\u0137i pa priek\u0161metiem.",kQ:"P\u0101rliecienies, ka ievad\u012btais skol\u0113na personas kods ir pareizs.\nJa tom\u0113r p\u0101rbaude neizdodas, pal\u016bdziet klases audzin\u0101t\u0101jam, lai p\u0101rbauda un E-klas\u0113 labo skol\u0113na personas kodu.",hY:"P\u0101rliecinieties, ka ievad\u012btais skol\u0113na personas kods ir pareizs.\nJa tom\u0113r p\u0101rbaude neizdodas, pal\u016bdziet klases audzin\u0101t\u0101jam, lai p\u0101rbauda un E-klas\u0113 labo skol\u0113na personas kodu.",aR:"P\u0113c datu iesnieg\u0161anas Jums vairs neb\u016bs iesp\u0113jas labot un skat\u012bt aptaujas datus.",ih:"RELOAD_IGNORING_LOCAL_AND_REMOTE_CACHE_DATA",lN:"SMS abonementu var atcelt tikai vienu reizi. To atk\u0101rtoti aktiviz\u0113t b\u016bs iesp\u0113jams tikai p\u0113c n\u0101kam\u0101 abonementa ieg\u0101des.",d5:"Sal\u012bdzini uzdevumu v\u0113rt\u0113jumus starp klases skol\u0113niem un v\u0113l. ",hg:"Sal\u012bdzini vid\u0113jo v\u0113rt\u0113jumu katru m\u0113nesi un v\u0113l",t:"Sal\u012bdzini v\u0113rt\u0113jumu starp klases skol\u0113niem un v\u0113l.",c1:"Sa\u0146em Push-notifik\u0101cijas par v\u0113rt\u0113jumiem, v\u0113stul\u0113m, ierakstiem un kav\u0113jumiem.",dy:"Skol\u0113na apmekl\u0113juma grafiks, apmekl\u0113to stundu skaits.",jP:"Skol\u0113na dienas atz\u012bmju un kav\u0113jumu apkopojums",im:"Something went wrong, please report the issue https://www.github.com/incrediblezayed/file_saver/issues",V:"Stream has been disposed.\nAn ImageStream is considered disposed once at least one listener has been added and subsequently all listeners have been removed and no handles are outstanding from the keepAlive method.\nTo resolve this error, maintain at least one listener on the stream, or create an ImageStreamCompleterHandle from the keepAlive method, or create a new stream for the image.",kP